ction checks.\n\nAdd Java assertions for parser results, task-list indexes, command argument\ncounts, and task descriptions loaded from storage. Enable assertions during\nGradle test and application runs so these assumptions are checked during\ndevelopment without replacing user-facing validation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"7681c3329c981bcd940ca8ae8dc0210199c43201","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request from branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add assertions for internal invariants","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"725086586f2859a4ad2604ff6a7cd7add3a86312","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve command dispatch readability","messageBody":"Align switch cases with the surrounding switch statement so the command loop is easier to scan. The change follows the code-quality guidance on logical structure and avoids misleading indentation without changing command behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":32,"deletions":32}}},{"hash":"493b215b2fc320fb711376b72ea3bdcf616d1e69","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Simplify event argument validation","messageBody":"Move repeated empty-argument checks into a named helper so the parser condition is easier to understand. This follows the code-quality guidance on avoiding complicated expressions while preserving the existing validation behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"10ae4bc62302b31fbd01e875182a00e7d74fdf5a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams for task filtering","messageBody":"TaskList filtering uses manual loops for date and keyword searches.\n\nUsing Java Streams improves consistency with the A-Streams requirement\nwhile preserving task ordering and existing filtering behavior.\n\nReplace the filtering loops with stream pipelines and extract date\nmatching into a dedicated helper method.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":22,"deletions":25}}},{"hash":"0a42f955891893aa4fb4a797de94adb482ba5bb7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"7ab10cc9c7c0ef290416e475a7fd605759be2af3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from euanlt/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Use streams for task filtering","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d8797b04596daf8757daa90e1b19ad29456e0561","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"523a0ba62de0b471de843437fabeae22740d0886","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from euanlt/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Branch a code quality","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b3e552b3a7bac8eea4286d6ec56dab19c70e055f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Set up GitHub Actions CI","messageBody":"","tags":["A-CI"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"3f5073f996aa5e46f556b71f71ca71a493f623c8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add snooze command","messageBody":"Tasks cannot be postponed without manually deleting and recreating them,\nwhich makes rescheduling inconvenient.\n\nLet\u0027s add a snooze command that moves deadlines to a new date/time and\nshifts events while preserving their duration.\n\nReject snoozing todos because they do not have schedule information.\nPersist all rescheduled tasks using the existing storage format.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":54,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"56ff1a4cd5cb7af0d2ed144d9fd7225690273f85","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-B-Snooze\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["BCD-Extension"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash